  "problem": "$$\n{f}_{Y\\,|\\,X}(y\\,|\\,x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}3{e}^{-3y}, & 0\\le x\\le 1,\\,y\\ge 0 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\\,{f}_{X}(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}2x, & 0\\le x\\le 1 \\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the continuous random variables $X$ and $Y,$ for which the conditional probability density function ${f}_{Y\\,|\\,X}(y\\,|\\,x)$ and the marginal density function ${f}_{X}(x)$ are shown above. Find the expression of the joint probability density function $f(x,y)$ for $0\\le x\\le 1,\\,y\\ge 0.$",
